## 5. Final Technology Stack

| Component | Choice | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend | Streamlit | Fastest path to a working demo; well-suited to tab/card layouts |
| Backend Orchestration | **LangGraph** | Stateful multi-agent pipelines; conditional routing by input type; observable step-by-step progress |
| LLM | OpenRouter free-tier (`openrouter/free` auto-router) | User holds key; auto-router hedges against model rotation/rate-limiting |
| Embeddings (URL/Text) | **HuggingFace `sentence-transformers` (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`)** | Free, runs locally, no API quota; ~90 MB RAM acceptable on Streamlit Cloud |
| Vector Store (URL/Text) | **FAISS** (CPU, session-scoped `.index`) | Fast in-process similarity search; no external dependency; index stored in `session_state` bytes and discarded on session end |
| PDF Retrieval | **Vectorless page-tree index** | Reliable page citations; avoids unnecessary embedding step for structured PDFs |
| Web Scraping | `trafilatura` | Clean article/text extraction from URLs; built-in encoding handling |
| Data Validation | Pydantic v2 | All LangGraph node inputs/outputs + LLM JSON outputs validated against schemas |
| Session Cache | Streamlit `session_state` | No cross-session state needed; no external dependency |
| PDF Parsing | PyMuPDF (`fitz`) | Fast, reliable, page-aware |
| Hosting | Streamlit Community Cloud | Native Streamlit, free, GitHub-integrated, public URL |
| CI | GitHub Actions (lint + pytest) | Automatic on push; no custom CD needed |
| Testing | pytest + unittest.mock | Unit, integration, and AI eval fixtures |

**Free-tier notes:**
- `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` downloads once on first run (~90 MB) and is cached in Streamlit Cloud's ephemeral container
- FAISS is CPU-only (no GPU needed), fast on small document sizes
- OpenRouter free models ~20 req/min; `openrouter/free` auto-router mitigates single-model exhaustion
- Streamlit Community Cloud apps sleep after inactivity; warm before judging

