## 18. Deployment Architecture

### Local Development
```bash
streamlit run frontend/Home.py
```
With `frontend/.streamlit/secrets.toml` (gitignored) holding `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`.

### Production Environment
Streamlit Community Cloud, connected to GitHub repository. Main file: `frontend/Home.py`.

### Environment Variables
| Variable | Purpose | Required |
|---|---|---|
| `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` | LLM completions via OpenRouter | Yes |

*(HuggingFace embeddings run locally — no API key needed.)*

### Free-Tier Limitations
- App sleeps after inactivity; cold start ~30–60s — warm before judging
- OpenRouter free models ~20 req/min; auto-router mitigates single-model exhaustion
- HuggingFace model downloads once on first run (~90 MB); cached for session lifetime
- FAISS is CPU-only; fast on small document sizes

