## 21. Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Category | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| LangGraph adds complexity that slows delivery | Technical | Each graph node is isolated and testable independently; graph wiring is the last step per feature, not the first |
| HuggingFace model download fails on Streamlit Cloud | Technical | Cache model to `~/.cache/huggingface` on first run; Streamlit Cloud supports this in ephemeral containers |
| FAISS session-state bytes exceed Streamlit Cloud memory | Technical | Only URL/text use FAISS; for typical document sizes, FAISS index for ~512-token chunks is small (~few MB) |
| Free OpenRouter model rotated or rate-limited | Technical | `openrouter/free` auto-router fallback; test against multiple models early |
| LLM returns malformed JSON | Technical | Schema validation + one retry + graceful `Unclear` degradation; LangGraph conditional edge to degraded node |
| Comparison of structurally different documents produces poor alignment | Product | Semantic cosine alignment (not positional); "Requires review" catch-all category |
| Scope creep toward legal outcome prediction | Product | Explicit non-goal; enforced at prompt level |
| Prompt injection via document content | Security | Delimiter-based isolation; citation-required outputs; no LLM control over app flow |
| SSRF via URL input | Security | HTTPS-only, private-IP blocking, timeout, size cap |
| Sensitive content in logs | Security | Metadata-only logging |
| Timeline slips on comparison feature | Timeline | Scheduled after core single-doc feature works; partial cut still leaves a demo-able product |

